OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFriday will start wet with some
OL,6,Frain around, coupled with breezy
OL,7,Fconditions at times. Skies will slowly
OL,8,Fbrighten from the northwest though,
OL,9,Fleaving a mostly fine afternoon with
OL,10,Fplenty of sunny spells. Staying
OL,11,Fbreezy, and feeling fresher than
OL,12,Frecently.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA dry and settled night is on
OL,15,Fthe cards with clear spells. However,
OL,16,Fas winds ease a few mist patches may
OL,17,Fform, and turning chilly in some rural
OL,18,Fspots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
