OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FAny early mist clearing to
OL,6,Fleave plenty of dry and bright weather
OL,7,Fwith gentle winds on Saturday. Some
OL,8,Fcloud arriving from the west later
OL,9,Fthough, and staying fresher.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FWarm
OL,12,Fsunshine on Sunday, although turning
OL,13,Fwindy. Rain overnight, then some
OL,14,Fsunshine on Monday. Further wet and
OL,15,Fwindy weather arriving later, followed
OL,16,Fby sunshine and some blustery showers
OL,17,Fon Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
